Cell["\<\

For an interior singular phenotype, \[Beta] < 2 f2 s0, so this derivative is \
positive.  Decreasing survival therefore decreases the evolved population \
size.  The evolution of greater current reproduction only partly compensates \
for the loss of future reproduction.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997072323526969*^9, 
  3.997072330376786*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"21cb0896-2f57-4570-afa6-\
29d14d0dfeea"]
}, Open  ]]
